[2026-01-30T14:57:22.269Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_016T2j2ZNvYGVbKkggjKVASP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The requirement has been completed. Here's a summary:\n\n## Completed: Unify Animation Utilities into Shared Library\n\n### Created Files (`src/lib/animation/`)\n\n1. **easing.ts** - Comprehensive easing functions:\n   - Cubic, Quart, Quint (varying intensity)\n   - Expo (snappy), Sine (gentle), Circ (physical)\n   - Back (overshoot), Elastic (bouncy), Bounce\n   - `easingPresets` for common use cases (interaction, fade, charts, etc.)\n\n2. **spring.ts** - Spring physics and interpolation:\n   - `spring()` - Frame-based spring animation\n   - `staggeredSpring()` - Staggered list animations\n   - `timeSpring()` - Time-based (milliseconds) spring\n   - `physicsSpring()` - Physics-based with velocity\n   - `interpolate()`, `interpolateMultiple()` - Value mapping\n   - `springPresets`, `physicsPresets` for common configurations\n\n3. **hooks.ts** - React hooks for animations:\n   - `useSpring()` - Animate 0 to 1 on mount\n   - `useSpringTrigger()` - Manual trigger with forward/reverse\n   - `useStagger()` - Staggered progress for lists\n   - `useReveal()` - Slide + fade reveal styles\n   - `usePhysicsSpring()` - Physics spring with target\n   - `usePulse()` - Continuous pulsing\n   - `useAnimatedValue()` - Smooth value transitions\n\n4. **transitions.tsx** - Transition components:\n   - `Crossfade`, `Slide`, `Scale`, `Stagger`, `Reveal`, `Zoom`\n   - `CountUp`, `Pulse`, `Typewriter`, `FadeInOut`\n   - `transitionPresets` for common configurations\n\n5. **index.ts** - Barrel exports with documentation\n\n### Updated Files\n\n1. **useVideoPlayback.ts** - Re-exports animation utilities from shared library (143 → 83 lines)\n2. **Transitions.tsx** - Re-exports components from shared library (166 → 14 lines)\n3. **AnimatedCharts.tsx** - Updated import to use shared library\n\n### Benefits\n- Single source of truth for all animation utilities\n- Eliminated ~200 lines of duplicate code\n- Consistent easing and timing across all components\n- React hooks for UI animations, frame-based functions for video\n- Type-safe with full TypeScript support\n- Backward compatible via re-exports"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":469,"cache_read_input_tokens":123782,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":469},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"063d9692-0974-4418-8890-3933b0ef315a","uuid":"a2559a76-aeab-4fba-b52d-680c3c01195a"}
